# ==============================================================================
# GEO Auditor — Environment Files Overview
# ==============================================================================
# Environment configuration has been separated into respective client and server files:
#
# 1. Server Configuration (Backend, API keys, Database):
#    Location: server/.env
#    Template: server/.env.example
#
#    PORT=3000
#    SERPAPI_KEY=your_serpapi_key_here
#    DATABASE_URL=postgresql://localhost:5432/geo_auditor
#
# 2. Client Configuration (Vite frontend):
#    Location: client/.env
#    Template: client/.env.example
#
#    VITE_PORT=5173
#    VITE_API_URL=http://localhost:3000
# ==============================================================================
